title: "AgentSC-Bench: An Open Benchmark for Reliable Agentic AI in Multi-Echelon Supply Chains"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-16
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Goumri"
    given-names: "Mohammed Amine"
    orcid: ""
    affiliation: ""
    email: "mohammedaminegoumri@proton.me"
abstract: >
  An open, reproducible experimental framework for systematically evaluating
  architectures of LLM-based autonomous agents in multi-echelon supply chains,
  with explicit measurement of reliability, coordination quality, bullwhip effects,
  disruption recovery, autonomy and decision consistency.
keywords:
  - supply chain
  - multi-agent systems
  - large language models
  - benchmark
  - bullwhip effect
  - reliability
  - beer game
